        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana WP350 3-3/4\" Early American Cabinet Pull</b>\r\n<p>\r\nMade of solid brass this Early American styled pull handle is great for cabinets,  drawers, furniture or small utility type doors. They are surface mounted to the doors face in the classic early american style. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available in other sizes:  <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-4-inch-early-american-cabinet-pull-deltana-wp026\"><b>4\" Early American Cabinet Pull</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-6-inch-utility-pull-handle-deltana-wp27\"><b>6\" Early American Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/deltana-WP350-size.gif?v=1704442258\" width=\"580\" height=\"200\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana WP350 Early American Cabinet Pull Size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nEach cabinet pull includes matching finish screws for easy installation.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications:</b> for Deltana WP350 Cabinet Pull\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 3-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Plate Height: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/WP350.pdf?v=1691095378\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana WP350 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nWe offer 9 different finishes for this pull, but no matter which finish you choose, the cabinet handle will still be <b>high quality solid brass</b>. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<b>**Note: This item is discontinued. Please use <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-4-inch-early-american-cabinet-pull-deltana-wp026\"><b>Deltana WP026 4\" Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n<br><br>\r\n</p>",
